        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A key strategic emphasis has been for our business segments to operate in cooperation to provide products and services to our customers and to build stronger and more profitable relationships using our OCR sales and service process, which aligns to our vision to be the leading people-first, customer-centered bank in the country.",
        "start_character": 3309,
        "end_character": 3639
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For each business segment, we expect the combination of our business model, investment in products and capabilities, and exceptional service to provide a competitive advantage that supports revenue and earnings growth.",
        "start_character": 2878,
        "end_character": 3096
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, we continue to invest in and evolve our innovation program to develop, incubate, and launch new products and services driving ongoing differentiated value for our customers.",
        "start_character": 14695,
        "end_character": 14877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our subsidiaries, we provide full-service commercial and consumer deposit, lending, and other banking and financial services.",
        "start_character": 398,
        "end_character": 531
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer our customers money movement services through payment platforms such as Real-Time Payments (RTP®) and Zelle®.",
        "start_character": 7480,
        "end_character": 7603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer merchant services to our business and commercial customers.",
        "start_character": 7411,
        "end_character": 7479
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Following the completion of our merger with Cadence Bank on February 1, 2026, as further discussed below, we operate nearly 1,400 branches in 21 states, with certain businesses operating in extended geographies.",
        "start_character": 900,
        "end_character": 1111
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In particular, our payments capabilities continue to expand as we develop unique solutions for our diverse client segments, including Huntington ChoicePay.",
        "start_character": 8090,
        "end_character": 8245
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
        "accession_number": "0000049196-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The responsible way in which we operate our Company enables us to live Our Purpose of making people’s lives better, helping businesses thrive, and strengthening the communities we serve.",
        "start_character": 77328,
        "end_character": 77514
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000049196-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000049196-26-000015-8634c4eb9abd37a8",
