        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under the Volcker Rule, we are prohibited from (1) engaging in short-term proprietary trading for our own account and (2) having certain ownership interests in and relationships with hedge funds or private equity funds (covered funds).",
